<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύ̆ᾰλ-ον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύελον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sputum,
				saliva</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prog.</u>
				15
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Acut.</u>
				66
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αλ-</span>), al., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				607a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				747a10
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύελος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EE</u>
				1235a38
			</span></i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				7.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίαλος</span>
			.—The forms in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτυαλ-</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτυελ-</span> are found in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> (v. Kuehlewein i p.cvi) and of later writers; in those of <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> the latter only is found.</div>
